      "d": "Ayat al-Kursi and the mu'awwidhat — what the Prophet ﷺ recited before sleep.",
      "t": "Before sleep"
    },
    "c7": {
      "d": "To enter the day with remembrance.",
      "t": "Ayat for the morning"
